ery intoxicating sip.', 145000, 'IDR', 2), ('FORGOTTEN ARAK', 'GALANG KANGIN', 'Inspired by the eastern sun and ancestral spirits, Galang Kangin is a tribute to new beginnings. Rooted in arak and lifted by brightness, it captures the quiet power of dawn in a glass of light and balance.', 120000, 'IDR', 0), ('FORGOTTEN ARAK', 'NAGA RAJA', 'A tribute to the sacred dragon, guardian of balance and abundance. Drawing from ancient island mythology, Naga Raja is a vibrant, commanding blend where tradition and imagination rise as one.', 120000, 'IDR', 1), ('FORGOTTEN ARAK', 'SAMUDERA', 'An echo of Bali’s sacred shores, where the ocean is the source of life. Samudera reflects the depth of vibrant waters, carrying the gentle motion of waves and the breath of tropical winds in every sip.', 120000, 'IDR', 2), ('FORGOTTEN ARAK', 'WENARA WANA', 'Inspired by the dense forests of Ubud and the legends of the monkey king. Wenara Wana is a tribute to the forest monarch, capturing playful energy, curiosity, and wild freedom in every vibrant sip.', 120000, 'IDR', 3), ('FORGOTTEN ARAK', 'UBUD RITUAL', 'Inspired by unspoken moments shared in silence and incense smoke. Ubud Ritual is private, balanced, and quietly dangerous. Crafted for those who know to look beyond the surface of the sacred.', 120000, 'IDR', 4), ('ZERO PROOF', 'DAWN AT UBUD', 'A crisp, golden awakening that captures the first light of Ubud’s morning dew.', 60000, 'IDR', 0), ('ZERO PROOF', 'SILENT OFFERING', 'A graceful tribute to the quiet moments of gratitude found in island rituals.', 60000, 'IDR', 1), ('ZERO PROOF', 'TEMPLE MIST', 'Cooling and ethereal, like the sacred breeze drifting through ancient stone walls.', 60000, 'IDR', 2), ('ZERO PROOF', 'SACRED MISCHIEF', 'A playful dance of island flavors, celebrating the spirited energy of the forest.', 60000, 'IDR', 3), ('ZERO PROOF', 'BERRY SPARK', 'Effervescent and joyful. A vibrant celebration of summer’s sweetest berries.', 60000, 'IDR', 4)) as i(sec, name, descr, price, cur, pos) on i.sec = secs.name;

